I came to my house by bus.
My apartment was very quiet.
I put down my bag and opened my laptop.
It is morning in Mexico right now and it is night in India.
I made a video call to my mother.
It rang for a little while.
Then mother's face came on the screen.
She answered the call with a lovely smile.
"Hello mother."
"How are you?"
I asked.
Mother saw me.
"Hello Maya," mother said lovingly.
"I am absolutely fine, my child."
"How are you?"
"Did you go to the office today?"
"Yes mother, I went to the office," I answered.
"And in the evening I played badminton with my friends."
"Today was a very good day," I said.
Mother listened to me with a smile.
